---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Travel Insurance for China: What to Look For";
const description = "Why you need travel insurance for China, what it should cover, and recommended providers verified for China coverage.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/en/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life in China
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏥 Medical Care</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Travel Insurance for China<br class="hidden md:block" />: What to Look For
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Get travel insurance before your trip. This is not optional.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 4 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Yes, you need travel insurance for China.</strong> Even though medical costs are lower than in the West, a serious incident can still cost tens of thousands of RMB. Get a policy with at least $100,000 USD medical coverage, emergency evacuation, and 24/7 English-speaking assistance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Even though China's medical costs are much lower than in the US, a serious incident — car accident, heart attack, emergency surgery — can still cost tens of thousands of RMB. Insurance turns that from a life-ruining expense into a manageable process.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> What Your Insurance Should Cover for China
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Coverage</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Why You Need It</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Medical expenses</td><td class="px-6 py-4">At least $100,000 USD coverage</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Emergency evacuation</td><td class="px-6 py-4">If you need to be flown to another country for treatment</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Repatriation</td><td class="px-6 py-4">If the worst happens and your body needs to be sent home</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Trip cancellation</td><td class="px-6 py-4">If you need to cancel due to illness</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Lost baggage</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Standard coverage</td></tr>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">24/7 assistance hotline</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Must have English-speaking operators</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏆</span> Recommended Insurance Providers
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-1">World Nomads</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 mb-3">Best for: adventure travelers, backpackers, and short-term tourists</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• Covers 300+ activities including hiking the Great Wall, cycling, and water sports</li>
            <li>• Two plans: Standard (budget) and Explorer (adventure-focused with higher limits)</li>
            <li>• Emergency medical, evacuation, trip cancellation, and baggage coverage</li>
            <li>• 24/7 emergency assistance with multi-language support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-1">SafetyWing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-green-600 mb-3">Best for: digital nomads, remote workers, and long-term travelers</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• Subscription-based — pay monthly, cancel anytime, no long-term commitment</li>
            <li>• Nomad Insurance starts at ~$45/month, covers medical, evacuation, and trip interruption</li>
            <li>• Global coverage including China, with automatic renewal for extended stays</li>
            <li>• Also offers Nomad Health (true health insurance with outpatient coverage)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-1">AXA Travel Insurance (AXA Assistance)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-purple-600 mb-3">Best for: comprehensive coverage (primarily for US/European residents)</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>• Four plan tiers from OnTrip (basic) to Elite (maximum coverage)</li>
            <li>• Explorer Select and Elite plans cover pre-existing conditions</li>
            <li>• 24/7 assistance hotline with English-speaking operators</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>Note:</strong> Brand names above are plain text for now. Affiliate links will be added once the affiliate program is set up, turning each brand name into a clickable link.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 Related Guides</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/en/medical/seeing-a-doctor/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Seeing a Doctor in China</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Clinics, hospitals, and what to expect</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/medical/top-hospitals/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Top Hospitals with International Departments</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Best hospitals for foreigners in China</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/tips/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Emergency Numbers & What to Do</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Save these before you need them</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>